research/audit/wave7-refuter-tasks/lem-nth-term-test.md-90-- **What the proof actually uses.** Only that the partial sums converge and that consecutive partial sums differ by a term. No sign hypothesis is placed on $(a_k)$, and none is available at this point on the page.
