research/audit/wave7-preserved-refuters/fs-nth-term-test-converse--47780c235cfbe92f.prompt.md-1074-[L1] The recursion clause of the finite sum: $s_{n+1} = s_n + a_n$ for every $n \in \mathbb{N}$ ([[def-finite-sum]], [[def-series]]).
