research/audit/wave7-preserved-refuters/fs-nth-term-test-converse--47780c235cfbe92f.log-11-  evidence: The root test and the ratio test both yield limit 1 for the series $\sum 1/k$ and $\sum 1/k^2$, so they are inconclusive and do not separate these two series. The statement that *each* of the listed tests separates $1/k$ from $1/k^2$ is therefore false.
