research/audit/wave7-preserved-refuters/thm-geometric-series--cd0838e53d925e6e.prompt.md-1246-
research/audit/wave7-preserved-refuters/thm-geometric-series--cd0838e53d925e6e.prompt.md-1247-**Given:** A sequence $(a_k)$ of reals whose series converges, with partial sums $s_n = \sum_{k<n} a_k$ ([[def-series]], [[def-finite-sum]]).
