research/audit/wave7-preserved-refuters/thm-geometric-series--cd0838e53d925e6e.prompt.md-1265-2.1 Hence $(a_n)$ is the difference of two sequences converging to $S$, so it converges to $S - S = 0$. [step 1.1, step 1.2, A1, L3]
